<DocsExample TExample="DataGridBasicExample" Title="Columns and sorting" Description="Property columns read a value from each item, format it and sort it. Select a header to change the sort." />
<DocsExample TExample="DataGridTemplateColumnExample" Title="Template columns and row clicks" Description="NTTemplateColumn renders any content per row. OnRowClicked reports the row the user activated." />
<DocsExample TExample="DataGridAppearanceExample" Title="Appearance and density" Description="Striped rows help scanning wide tables; compact density fits more rows on screen." />
<DocsExample TExample="DataGridPaginationExample" Title="Pagination" Description="ShowPagination splits rows into pages. QueryParameterPrefix keeps each grid's page in the URL without colliding with other grids." />
<DocsExample TExample="DataGridRowDetailsExample" Title="Row details" Description="RowDetailTemplate adds an expandable detail area to each row. RowKey keeps expansion stable across updates." />
<DocsExample TExample="DataGridProviderExample" Title="Loading data on demand" Description="ItemsProvider requests one sorted window at a time, so large or remote data sets never load all at once." />
